{"id":"wb-7-1606","name":"康家石门子岩雕刻画","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"康家石门子岩雕刻画","text":"康家石门子岩雕刻画，又作康家石门子岩画、康家石门子岩刻画、呼图壁岩画等，是位于新疆呼图壁县西南部山区的青铜时代大规模摩崖石刻。康家石门子岩雕刻画面积约120平方米，采用阴刻、浅浮雕等技艺制作而成。刻有超过300个姿态各异的人物、动物形象。其画面主题包括舞蹈以及男女交媾、夸张的生殖器官的生殖崇拜等。康家石门子岩雕刻画中早期的女性形象或为西王母文化的原型。2013年，康家石门子岩雕刻画被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BA%B7%E5%AE%B6%E7%9F%B3%E9%97%A8%E5%AD%90%E5%B2%A9%E9%9B%95%E5%88%BB%E7%94%BB","revisionId":95419713,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95419713","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9ee9435ad39815066118aa06.jpg","title":"康家石门子岩雕刻画所处岩壁.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%BA%B7%E5%AE%B6%E7%9F%B3%E9%97%A8%E5%AD%90%E5%B2%A9%E9%9B%95%E5%88%BB%E7%94%BB%E6%89%80%E5%A4%84%E5%B2%A9%E5%A3%81.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8b/%E5%BA%B7%E5%AE%B6%E7%9F%B3%E9%97%A8%E5%AD%90%E5%B2%A9%E9%9B%95%E5%88%BB%E7%94%BB%E6%89%80%E5%A4%84%E5%B2%A9%E5%A3%81.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​康家石门子岩雕刻画所处岩壁","width":320,"height":240}}